meta-spsdk
==========
This layer contains recipes for NXPs SPSDK [1] and its dependencies. We only
provide the recipes to use SPSDK in Yocto and are not responsible for SPSDK
itself.
We plan on upstreaming these recipes to meta-python and meta-freescale.

It is used to sign the boot container for i.MX95 machines supported in
meta-phytec.

[1] https://github.com/nxp-mcuxpresso/spsdk

Dependencies
============
openembedded-core (http://git.openembedded.org/openembedded-core)
meta-python (https://github.com/openembedded/meta-openembedded)

Patches
=======
Please submit any patches against the meta-spsdk layer as a PR on:

https://github.com/phytec/meta-spsdk

Maintainers
